type: text/vnd.tiddlywiki

* Resizing the window no longer rebuilds every indexer, and refreshes the page once per frame instead of twice. The `$:/info/browser/window/...` tiddlers now update individually through the new `$tw.wiki.updatePluginTiddlers()` method, so only the values that changed are reported
